    {
      "label": "COSC3500 Milestone 1 / Milestone 2 Specification",
      "file_type": "document",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 1",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Personalized spec (dated July 30, 2026) issued for a single student; sharing the document is a misconduct penalty. Defines one shared rubric for both milestone presentations.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_spec",
      "community": 0,
      "norm_label": "cosc3500 milestone 1 / milestone 2 specification"
    },
    {
      "label": "Milestone 1 (Serial Presentation)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 1",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Video-only deliverable, no in-person interview; likely less to talk about than Milestone 2, so shorter presentations are acceptable.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_milestone_1",
      "community": 0,
      "norm_label": "milestone 1 (serial presentation)"
    },
    {
      "label": "Milestone 2 (Parallel Presentation)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 1",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Adds an identity-verified in-person interview scheduled in the second week of exams (the week after the video submission is due). Using every parallel technique is not required; a single technique analysed thoroughly can earn an excellent mark.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_milestone_2",
      "community": 0,
      "norm_label": "milestone 2 (parallel presentation)"
    },
    {
      "label": "Shared Marking Rubric",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 1",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "The same basic rubric is used for both the Serial (Milestone 1) and Parallel (Milestone 2) presentations so feedback from Milestone 1 can be applied directly to Milestone 2.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_marking_rubric",
      "community": 3,
      "norm_label": "shared marking rubric"
    },
    {
      "label": "10-Minute Video Presentation",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 1",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Strict 10-minute maximum; assessors stop watching after 10 minutes. Quality over duration: a shorter high-quality presentation beats a longer low-quality one; time allocation across topics is a strategic choice since different models need different amounts of background. Multiple takes and splicing are allowed but the face must remain visible throughout.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_video_presentation",
      "community": 0,
      "norm_label": "10-minute video presentation"
    },
    {
      "label": "Identity Verification (pass/fail)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 2",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "The presentation doubles as identity-verified assessment: the student's face must be visible in the presentation, and abrupt head movement across splices is tolerated since the face is only checked for identity.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_identity_verification",
      "community": 0,
      "norm_label": "identity verification (pass/fail)"
    },
    {
      "label": "In-Person Interview (Milestone 2 only, pass/fail)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 2",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Identity-verified hurdle: approximately 7 minutes long, held in the second week of exams (the week after the Milestone 2 video is due); must be passed to pass Milestone 2 and hence the course. Milestone 1 has no interview.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_in_person_interview",
      "community": 0,
      "norm_label": "in-person interview (milestone 2 only, pass/fail)"
    },
    {
      "label": "Introduction and Background (20%)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 2",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Brings assessors up to speed on the simulated model; each presentation must be self-contained because assessors will likely not remember Milestone 1 when watching Milestone 2. Overlap between milestones is expected.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_introduction_and_background",
      "community": 3,
      "norm_label": "introduction and background (20%)"
    },
    {
      "label": "Optimisation (25%)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 2",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Covers optimisations attempted and their performance, techniques tried that failed or were considered and rejected, how the problem was structured and/or parallelised (Milestone 2) for speed, and trade-offs made.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_optimisation",
      "community": 2,
      "norm_label": "optimisation (25%)"
    },
    {
      "label": "Benchmarking (25%)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 2",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Benchmark setup must avoid inaccurate/misleading results; discussion should cover Amdahl's law and Gustafson's law (Milestone 2), hotspot and bottleneck identification, and how performance scales with problem size. Benchmarks must run on at least one of the UQ clusters.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_benchmarking",
      "community": 1,
      "norm_label": "benchmarking (25%)"
    },
    {
      "label": "Presentation (20%)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 2",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Assesses conveying results via visual and verbal presentation: choice of topics and time allocated to each, verbal delivery, slide design, and data visualisation/representation.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_presentation_criterion",
      "community": 3,
      "norm_label": "presentation (20%)"
    },
    {
      "label": "Reflection/Conclusion (10%)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 2",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Summarise main conclusions: what was learnt or most surprising, what would be done differently, how the work would be extended with more time; for Milestone 1, plans for Milestone 2.",
      "id": "cosc3500_milestone_reflection_conclusion",
      "community": 3,
      "norm_label": "reflection/conclusion (10%)"
    },
    {
      "label": "Code Submission (pass/fail)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "source_file": "COSC3500_Milestone.pdf",
      "source_location": "page 2",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Well-commented source code plus associated files (Makefiles, slurm scripts) needed to compile and check the code. Not directly assessed; required to verify the presented models were actually implemented and as reference for assessors.",
